pedalboard-os (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Systemd service units for JACK, mod-host, bridge, MOD UI.
  * Gig mode (pedalboard-gig.target) and studio mode (pedalboard-dev.target).
  * Udev rules for MIDI device auto-connect.
  * Audio configuration and AIDA-X model files.

